WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.769
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.905
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.206
Let's get to some news.

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:08.908
Well, guys, today,
the White House announced

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.110
that President Biden
will have his first

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.348
one-on-one meeting with
Vladimir Putin on June 16th.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.816
[ Audience "Oohs" ]
Yeah.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.285
It's a nice reminder that,
after a year in quarantine,

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.321
you're gonna have to see
some people you don't like.

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:24.757
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.492
I can't wait to see
how these two guys

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.527
try to out-macho each other
during the summit.

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:31.064
It's like, "I don't need
a bathroom break. Do you?"

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.366
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.101
"No, in fact,
let's take off our shirts

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.737
and have a pec-flexing contest."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.738
Yep, this will be
their first in-person meeting

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:43.042
since Biden told Putin,
"I don't think you have a soul."

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:45.078
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:47.146
It's gonna be fun
when Putin tells Biden,

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:50.049
"Say once more so I can use
for outgoing voicemail.

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.050
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:54.086
And go now.
Say now."

00:00:54.086 --> 00:00:56.622
The meeting will be part
of Biden's first foreign trip

00:00:56.622 --> 00:00:57.956
as president.

00:00:57.956 --> 00:01:00.226
He'll roll up like every other
American in Europe --

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.862
fanny pack, selfie stick,
and a love for saying,

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:05.798
"Hey, they have a McDonald's."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:09.001
Yeah, it'll be Biden's
first foreign trip as President,

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:10.470
and let's hope
it's just as satisfying

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.672
as his first domestic trip.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.006
Whoop.
-Whoa!

00:01:14.006 --> 00:01:15.775
-Oh.
Hey, oh!

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.176
[ Cymbals crash ]
-Whoa!

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:19.245
Like four trips in one
on that one, right there, yeah.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:20.980
-Oh.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.148
-Well, here's some good news.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.616
As of today,
half of all adults in the U.S.

00:01:24.616 --> 00:01:26.252
are now fully vaccinated.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.253
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:30.423
♪♪

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:32.959
[ Applause ]

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:35.127
That's right.
Half of America is vaccinated,

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:37.229
while the other half
uses Facebook.

00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:42.402
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:45.004
That's right, 50%.
So basically,

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.406
one Johnson is vaccinated,
the other Johnson isn't.

00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:49.509
You know what I'm saying?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:52.812
Well, if people need yet another
incentive for the vaccine,

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:56.015
United Airlines is offering
its vaccinated customers

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.818
the chance to win
a year of free travel.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.920
That's right.
United's first prize

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:04.791
is a year of free travel, while
the second prize is two years.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:09.661
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.661 --> 00:02:11.431
"I'm good. I'm good."

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:13.833
Hey, I saw that
Mike and Karen Pence

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:17.303
just bought a new house
right outside of Indianapolis.

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.005
At first, Karen thought
the house was haunted,

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:20.907
but it was just Mike
stepping out of the shower.

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:21.941
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:23.443
"You really are white, wow."

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:26.379
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:29.782
"I can see through you, yeah.
He's translucent. Unbelievable."

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:31.417
"It's more
of a frosted-glass look."

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:33.352
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:35.788
Get this. In Georgia,
officials are asking residents

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.925
to stop calling 9-1-1
about cicadas.

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:40.192
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.192 --> 00:02:41.694
Stop it.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.796
Stop calling 9-1-1
about cicadas.

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:45.865
Which backfired immediately
when a bunch of cicadas

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.033
robbed a 7-Eleven.

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.869
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:52.438
And finally, in Texas,
a woman decided to do something

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:56.041
pretty crazy at the El Paso Zoo.
Watch this.

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:58.277
-A zoo in Texas is trying
to track down the woman

00:02:58.277 --> 00:03:01.947
caught on video inside
the spider monkey exhibit.

00:03:01.947 --> 00:03:04.550
She reportedly hopped a barrier
at the El Paso Zoo

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:08.254
so she could feed the monkeys
Hot Cheetos.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:14.126
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:15.461
-Don't worry.
After the incident,

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:17.964
the woman was quickly returned
to her own enclosure.

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:19.331
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.331 --> 00:03:21.400
Yep, people were shocked,
while the monkeys were like,

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.403
"Carl, your Uber Eats is here."

